WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:05.240
Your house being ransacked,
your mother's disappearance,

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:10.280
and the disturbances at school may be related.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:14.110
It seems there are students
who are devil worshippers.

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:17.530
Where's the forbidden grimoire?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.870
I'll go talk to the police again.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.540
I'll contact them.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.830
They'll listen if it's someone
from the Kaginuki family.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:02.100
"Jitterbug of Doubts and Secrets"

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:17.070
You haven't changed your mind?

00:02:18.070 --> 00:02:20.610
Hmm? No.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.030
My brother will be back from England tonight,

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.620
so I'll stay with a friend until then.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.500
You'd be safer in the
Kaginuki home if something happened.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.040
But...

00:02:35.630 --> 00:02:36.920
I'll be fine.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.980
It's the Great Rem!

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.610
It's our lucky day!

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.200
What's wrong?

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:04.070
Nothing. Thank you for letting
me stay with you last night.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.580
Excuse me.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.340
What was <i>she</i> doing
in the Great Rem's limousine?

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.170
She got summoned yesterday, right?

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:18.210
That's Ritsuka Tachibana, the second-year.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:19.720
Think something really happened?

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:22.340
I'll make her pay if
she's trying to cozy up to him!

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:27.390
If only I could just shout,
"It's not like that!"

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:28.390
Ritsuka!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.770
Azuna!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:34.230
Thank goodness...

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.900
I was worried!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:42.530
I know, I'm sorry. I'm fine.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.740
Why should you apologize?

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:51.290
That's horrible. So... is your mom...?

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.040
No news yet.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.130
Oh.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:58.670
I'm sure the police will find her, though.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.170
The Kaginuki family is super powerful, huh?

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.840
Yeah. I take it back.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:06.220
Huh?

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:11.770
Yesterday I called the
student council president a jerk...

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:13.810
But he really helped me.

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:22.440
It was for the school's sake and not mine,
but still... he saved me.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.360
Yeah.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.410
"If it's for everyone's happiness,

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:34.420
I'm ready to have my body burned
like that Scorpion--even a hundred times."

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.590
The same old classroom...

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.590
"Milky Way Railroad"

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:40.920
The same old lessons...

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:44.130
But things aren't the same anymore.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.550
Mom...

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.100
"Modern Literature B"

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:58.020
Ritsuka.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.900
Let's hit the cafeteria.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.490
I'm not sure I'm hungry.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:08.700
At times like these,
you have to make sure to eat!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.580
Ritsuka!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.910
You have a visitor.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:20.670
Ritsuka Tachibana, the student
council president would like to see you.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.960
Did they find my mother?!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.220
No idea.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:29.010
Ritsuka, I'll come with you.

00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:30.010
No.

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:35.060
You can't come. You weren't asked for.

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.190
But--

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:39.980
Thanks, Azuna, but it's okay.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.280
Um...

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.490
So you came to school?

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:42.750
It's nice to see you again, my little butterfly.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:47.840
Er...

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:53.640
I'm Urie Sogami. Pleased to meet you.

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:57.980
Dump that silly Rem and come to <i>me</i> for help.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:02.520
I'll make your heart pound like crazy.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.860
No, um...

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.240
You're so cute.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.160
Stop messing with her, Urie.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.910
Are you okay? My name is Shiki Natsumezaka.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:20.160
Rem told us about you. Poor thing.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.880
Tell me if there's anything I can do.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.050
You poor, <i>poor</i> thing...

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:33.640
I shudder to think what other
bad things will happen to you.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.310
As usual, Shiki's being a creep.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:43.440
Hey. If you want help, come to <i>me</i>.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.940
Come to Mage Nanashiro.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.070
What are you doing?!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:54.240
Don't be shy! I'll protect you
from anyone you need me to.

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.830
No, thank you!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.500
Poor Mage, she ran from you!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.250
Shut up, killjoy.

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.920
Come on back, my butterfly.

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:06.670
Don't offer her your stinky flowers.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.250
Says the guy reeking with sweat.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.670
Sweat is a man's badge of honor!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:18.430
You see what they're like. <i>Me</i>, though--

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:28.480
That hurt, pooch. How about I put you to sleep?

00:08:29.270 --> 00:08:30.900
Um...

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.400
What are you doing?

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.950
Mr. President...

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.750
I was just on the phone with the police.

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:51.380
Um, is my mother...

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:58.600
They were able to capture the GPS data
from her phone, just for a moment.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.060
Where is she?

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.890
Nagano Prefecture, near Karuizawa.

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:05.440
Nagano?!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.480
Does that suggest anything to you?

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.610
My late grandfather's house is there.

00:09:09.610 --> 00:09:13.940
He studied demons and vampires, correct?

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:17.360
Yes. His research materials
are still at his house.

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.200
Let's go.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:28.000
Maybe we'll find a clue
as to where your mother is.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.930
"There's new information about Mom, so I'm
leaving with the student council president.
Sorry I couldn't eat lunch with you."

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.310
Ritsuka...

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:51.980
Why'd Rem bother taking the chick with him?
He should just go himself.

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:53.860
Rem's a sharp guy.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:10:01.070
He took her along because she might be useful.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:05.620
She might hold a clue
she doesn't know about, right?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:10.880
Gee, the Arlond heir sure has it rough!

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:14.840
Mage! He's the "Kaginuki" heir here.

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.970
Details.

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.150
You haven't had lunch, have you?

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:38.360
I'm not hungry.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:42.370
At times like these, one must eat properly.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.410
What?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:48.120
I'm sorry, it's just that
Azuna said the same thing.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:51.460
Just eat.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.790
Oh. Right.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.800
It's good!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:03.720
Thank you. Um, for everything.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:08.230
I haven't done anything that requires thanks.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:11.600
But you've helped me so much.

00:11:11.600 --> 00:11:14.980
Yesterday, and again now.

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:17.070
I'm truly grateful.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:29.500
Um, so... you must really love dogs.

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:34.790
I saw the Pomeranian
from your estate in the library earlier.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:38.050
Loewen just followed me there.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:39.920
So its name is Loewen?

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.970
No pointless chit-chat.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:42.970
All right.

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:53.940
You dislike shiitake mushrooms?

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.610
I don't "dislike" them.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.400
But--

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.450
Mushrooms are not food.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:06.280
They're a substance that results
from fungus adhering to trees.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.830
"Substance"?

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:31.100
There it is!

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.420
Mom?

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.260
Whoever did this might be inside.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.530
This is awful...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.660
Mom!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.660
Mom?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:01.520
She's not here... not anywhere.

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.330
That's Mom's!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:15.750
So she <i>was</i> here!

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.080
Mom...

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:26.880
Huh?

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.760
It's all right.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.890
We <i>will</i> find her.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:42.560
Chances are those devil
worshippers are behind this.

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:45.780
They likely came in search
of that forbidden grimoire

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.900
they mentioned yesterday.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.290
Does that ring any bells?

00:14:55.290 --> 00:15:00.040
No, not at all.
"Grimoire"--that's a book, right?

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.210
Yes, a book of magic.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:05.170
My grandfather had so many books and files;

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:08.260
I can't say that that wasn't among them.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:12.550
Was there somewhere he'd
store more valuable materials?

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:15.180
I wouldn't know.

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:21.440
When I was young, my mother
would take me here during holidays.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:25.360
My mother, my brother, and my grandfather...
We had so much fun.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:28.900
"To My Brother"

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.950
This is your grandfather and mother?

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.670
Yes. And my mother's sister.

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:47.880
Would she know anything about the grimoire?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.130
She passed away when I was a baby.

00:15:52.130 --> 00:15:53.260
I see.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.720
No point in tidying up today.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.600
But I can't leave it like this.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:06.610
I'll send over my servants later.
You can go with them then.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.490
Understood.

00:16:16.370 --> 00:16:17.740
Mom...

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.420
What's wrong?

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.000
It won't open!

00:16:28.170 --> 00:16:30.010
So we're trapped.

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:34.010
Wasn't there another entrance in the kitchen?

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:35.010
Yes.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.350
Move.

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:50.230
I'll get the fire extinguisher.

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.230
Wait!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.580
No!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:20.720
Get out of here.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.600
Quickly, now.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:27.600
Okay.

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:45.750
You call that fire?

00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.770
Hmph. You again.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.980
♪ Begone, you vulgar fellows ♪

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:13.900
♪ Block not the path I tread ♪

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:18.200
♪ My heart of ice will show no mercy ♪

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.950
♪ Learn your lesson well. ♪

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:26.830
♪ Dance in the palm of my hand,
you pitiful little marionettes ♪

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:31.840
♪ Dance until the hour of your doom ♪

00:18:34.960 --> 00:18:46.720
♪ She is mine! Keep your filthy hands off her ♪

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:52.270
♪ Hark! My name is Rem Arlond: ♪

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:58.860
♪ the prince of despair to whom
even the darkness grovels! ♪

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:04.410
♪ Now here's where the game ends ♪

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:09.370
♪ As I declare checkmate ♪

00:19:09.370 --> 00:19:14.130
♪ And thus the end of the dark-side game ♪

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.930
So one of you got away.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:25.140
Did you find the grimoire?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.520
I see. Not yet.

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.650
Dust to dust.

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:38.360
Checkmate.

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.040
Mr. President...

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:56.290
Mr. President!

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.920
It's all right.

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.530
Thank goodness...

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.320
Oh, thank goodness, Rem...

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.290
I'm fine.

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:48.180
How did it come to this? Mom...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.400
Head home.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.110
Yes, sir.

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.260
My brother!

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:34.890
Welcome home, big brother!

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.820
It'll be okay now, Ritsuka.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:32.300
I know a lot of things.
Like, say, about your brother's secret.

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:33.760
His secret?

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:36.600
Welcome to my Eden.

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:41.100
"Tango of Passion and Seduction"

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.810
Act 3: Tango of Passion and Seduction.
